slot. for Android: no blank flash at a Game Boy game's doors.
Pokemon Red, Blue and Yellow fade to black at each door, white the palette
out (or turn the screen off) while the next map loads, then show black
again: the blank screen flashed for six to eight frames. While the screen
is off, or the game's frame is all one colour other than the one-colour
frame before it (12 frames at most), the frame is painted that colour
before anything draws it, at every canvas size (ZOOM's AUTO ZOOM IN
changes it at the door). Screen off after a frame of several colours: that
frame is repeated. One line in the log the first times it happens.

